  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kanbeng Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Food Production and Processing (Peanuts) , Beneficiaries: 30 Members , Town/City: Souriel Moulaye commune, Kolda region , Summary: The project will provide equipment to improve peanut and grain processing as well as improve its organizational and financial management capacity. Additionally, training in financial and organizational management will be provided to help the group increase its management and operational capacity and become sustainable.,</narrative>
